File Index: 2 of 109
Audio ID: 7698673192835719857
Audio Duration: 2m 32.1s (152.06s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 07:44:03 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 14 | Text: 如果你家族里边几代人都是干体力活的
Segment #2   [00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,080] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 13 | Text: 那到了你这一辈儿想要做个生意
Segment #3   [00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,000] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 难度开笔登天
Segment #4   [00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:05,900] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 不是说能力不行
Segment #5   [00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,380] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 15 | Text: 而是你从根上就缺少做生意的东西
Segment #6   [00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,600] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 15 | Text: 反过来说你家里哪怕只是开个小卖部
Segment #7   [00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,720] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 摆个早餐餐
Segment #8   [00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,800] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 11 | Text: 甚至只是推个车卖个烤红薯
Segment #9   [00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,480] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 15 | Text: 但他们的孩子想要做生意上手就是比你快
Segment #10  [00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,520] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 12 | Text: 这一辈儿可能没办法大富大贵
Segment #11  [00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,060] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 但到了他的下一辈儿
Segment #12  [00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,380] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 10 | Text: 改命的概率就会大多了
Segment #13  [00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,120] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 这不是选选
Segment #14  [00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:22,880] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 而是规律
Segment #15  [00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:23,560] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 一代不伤
Segment #16  [00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,260] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 代代难伤
Segment #17  [00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:24,880] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 一代经伤
Segment #18  [00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:25,600] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 代代传承
Segment #19  [00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,760] | Elapsed:  16.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 它传承的不是钱
Segment #20  [00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,500] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 而是脑子里边的东西
Segment #21  [00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,000] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 比如说你父母是打工的
Segment #22  [00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,960] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 13 | Text: 那他们这辈子最深刻的体会是什么
Segment #23  [00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:32,540] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 3  | Text: 是稳定
Segment #24  [00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,500] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 11 | Text: 是每个月到账的那点工资
Segment #25  [00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,320] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 是无险一斤
Segment #26  [00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,220] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 10 | Text: 是不用操心明天有没有活干
Segment #27  [00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,240] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 后天有没有钱赚
Segment #28  [00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,460] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是这套逻辑
Segment #29  [00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:41,460] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 13 | Text: 已经在他们的脑子里面刻了一辈子
Segment #30  [00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,520] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 11 | Text: 所以他们能教给你的就是学们手艺
Segment #31  [00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:44,420] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 3  | Text: 进个厂
Segment #32  [00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,220] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 考个毕案
Segment #33  [00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,260] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 找一个稳定的工作
Segment #34  [00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:47,520] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 能养家户口就行
Segment #35  [00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:48,220] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 这不怪他们
Segment #36  [00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,020] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为他们的经历决定了
Segment #37  [00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,280] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 他们只能有这样的认知
Segment #38  [00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,320] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 3  | Text: 那问题来了
Segment #39  [00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,700] | Elapsed:  35.34s | Words: 13 | Text: 当你有一天突然有了创业的想法
Segment #40  [00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:55,620] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 你跟他们开口
Segment #41  [00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:56,680] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 你得到的会是什么
Segment #42  [00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:57,740] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 是全盘的否定
Segment #43  [00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:58,680] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 你有本钱吗
Segment #44  [00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,340] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 亏了怎么办
Segment #45  [00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:00,480] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 你有人脉吗
Segment #46  [00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,780] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 你懂怎么去做生意吗
Segment #47  [00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:03,120] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 你凭什么觉得你能行呢
Segment #48  [00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:04,220] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是在他们的世界里
Segment #49  [00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:06,480] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 11 | Text: 你的想法就是不切实际的幻想
Segment #50  [00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,660] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 趁早放弃
Segment #51  [00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:09,980] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 15 | Text: 这就是长期依赖于确定性收入的家庭
Segment #52  [00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:11,160] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 对不确定的本能反应
Segment #53  [00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:13,400] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 12 | Text: 这是一个属于他们的自我保护机制
Segment #54  [00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,380] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 13 | Text: 但你再看看那些做过生意的家庭
Segment #55  [00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:16,600] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 哪怕就是摆摊的
Segment #56  [00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,080] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们的认知就完全不同
Segment #57  [00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,800] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 11 | Text: 因为从小就被灌输了一个道理
Segment #58  [00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:20,660] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是打工打工
Segment #59  [00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:22,080] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 到头来还是一场空
Segment #60  [00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:23,120] | Elapsed:  54.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 你给别人干
Segment #61  [00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:23,980] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 干得再好
Segment #62  [00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:25,060] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 饭碗在别人的手里
Segment #63  [00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:25,960] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 你今天能挣一碗
Segment #64  [00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,040] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 明天就有可能被裁掉
Segment #65  [00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,360] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 9  | Text: 随时都有被替换的风险
Segment #66  [00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:30,020] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 所以他们很明白一个道理
Segment #67  [00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:31,660] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是只有自己手里有活路
Segment #68  [00:01:31,660 --> 00:01:33,260] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 那才是真正的活路
Segment #69  [00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:34,600] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 他们对创业理解是什么
Segment #70  [00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,480] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 5  | Text: 失败是常态
Segment #71  [00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,300] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 5  | Text: 起步难正常
Segment #72  [00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,460] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 遇到瓶颈正常
Segment #73  [00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:38,400] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 亏了赔了正常
Segment #74  [00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,420] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 但坚持做
Segment #75  [00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:40,540] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 做着做着就上手了
Segment #76  [00:01:40,540 --> 00:01:41,500] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 失败了不是笑话
Segment #77  [00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:42,540] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 3  | Text: 是经验
Segment #78  [00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:43,820] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 你今天摔的这个跟头
Segment #79  [00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,660] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 12 | Text: 就是为了明天能站稳的那个台阶
Segment #80  [00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:46,940] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 你跟他们说想做生意
Segment #81  [00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:48,440] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 他们不会问你有多少钱
Segment #82  [00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,500] | Elapsed:  74.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 不会问你有没有人脉
Segment #83  [00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,020] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 9  | Text: 他们只会问你打算做什么
Segment #84  [00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:51,760] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 4  | Text: 打算怎么做
Segment #85  [00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,940] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 需要什么样的帮助
Segment #86  [00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:53,900] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 你遇到的困难
Segment #87  [00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:55,140] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 我能不能帮你解决
Segment #88  [00:01:55,140 --> 00:01:56,360] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 4  | Text: 所以你看很多人
Segment #89  [00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,600] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是没有创业的心事
Segment #90  [00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:58,880] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不敢卖错那第一步
Segment #91  [00:01:58,880 --> 00:01:59,780] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 3  | Text: 为什么不敢
Segment #92  [00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,140] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为你身边没有指路的人
Segment #93  [00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,440] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 你问父母说不行
Segment #94  [00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,160] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 4  | Text: 你问亲戚
Segment #95  [00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,240] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 亲戚说太冒险了
Segment #96  [00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,540] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 你问朋友朋友说我也想
Segment #97  [00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:06,540] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是我也不敢
Segment #98  [00:02:06,540 --> 00:02:07,500] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以你被困在了
Segment #99  [00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:08,440] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 那个第一个门槛上
Segment #100 [00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:09,760] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 8  | Text: 没人告诉你门后是什么
Segment #101 [00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:11,120] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 你不知道推开之后
Segment #102 [00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,080] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 是悬崖还是大陆
Segment #103 [00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,800] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 4  | Text: 你开始怕了
Segment #104 [00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,580] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 你想要后退了
Segment #105 [00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:14,720] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后你告诉自己算了
Segment #106 [00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,460] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 我还是上班吧
Segment #107 [00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:16,820] | Elapsed:  93.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以说一带不伤
Segment #108 [00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:18,460] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 2  | Text: 如果你今天
Segment #109 [00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:19,520] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 还有那颗创业的心
Segment #110 [00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,780] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 那就不要轻易的放弃
Segment #111 [00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:21,560] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 或许你比别人
Segment #112 [00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,020] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 3  | Text: 起点低
Segment #113 [00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:23,340] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 或许你也没人指货
Segment #114 [00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:24,700] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 但你摔的每一个跟头
Segment #115 [00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:26,260] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 都是在给你的下一代葡萄
Segment #116 [00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:27,100] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 或许你这一代
Segment #117 [00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:28,040] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 没能大富大贵
Segment #118 [00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,340] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 但你改的是下一代的命
Segment #119 [00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:30,680] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #120 [00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,020] | Elapsed: 106.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
